f=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/alma/42?lang=eng&amp;id=p8#p8\">Alma 42:8</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"15.\" id=\"note15\" data-full-marker=\"15.\">\n<p data-aid=\"173868529\" id=\"p_tvP5q\">“<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/for-the-strength-of-youth/04-jesus-christ-will-help-you?lang=eng&amp;id=p_rna9f-p_zSJoQ#p_rna9f\">Jesus Christ Will Help You</a>,” in <cite>For the Strength of Youth: A Guide for Making Choices</cite> (2025), 19.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"16.\" id=\"note16\" data-full-marker=\"16.\">\n<p data-aid=\"173868533\" id=\"p_p1fDz\">“Gethsemane,” <cite>Hymns for Home and Church</cite>, Gospel Library.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"17.\" id=\"note17\" data-full-marker=\"17.\">\n<p data-aid=\"173868536\" id=\"p_nyszo\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/130?lang=eng&amp;id=p22#p22\">Doctrine and Covenants 130:22</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"18.\" id=\"note18\" data-full-marker=\"18.\">\n<p data-aid=\"173868539\" id=\"p_a3e41\">See <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/15?lang=eng&amp;id=p26#p26\">John 15:26</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/2-ne/32?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">2 Nephi 32:5</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/moro/8?lang=eng&amp;id=p26#p26\">Moroni 8:26</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/moro/10?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">10:5</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/8?lang=eng&amp;id=p2-p3#p2\">Doctrine and Covenants 8:2–3</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"19.\" id=\"note19\" data-full-marker=\"19.\">\n<p data-aid=\"173868543\" id=\"p_vN3n1\">“I Know My Father Lives,” <cite>Children’s Songbook</cite>, 5.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"20.\" id=\"note20\" data-full-marker=\"20.\">\n<p data-aid=\"173868546\" id=\"p_dwAMd\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/1-ne/8?lang=eng&amp;id=p12#p12\">1 Nephi 8:12</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"21.\" id=\"note21\" data-full-marker=\"21.\">\n<p data-aid=\"173868547\" id=\"p_bhkt9\">Show <em>love</em> for others, <em>share</em> the fruits of the gospel with others, and <em>invite</em> others to partake of the sweet fruit of the gospel with you (see “Come unto Christ,” <a href=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/comeuntochrist/love-share-invite\">ChurchofJesusChrist.org</a>).</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</footer>","footnotes":{"note1":{"id":"note1","marker":"1.","pid":"173868253","context":"","text":"<p data-aid=\"173868457\" id=\"p_ffte0\">“<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/personal-development-childrens-guidebook/you-have-a-purpose?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\">You Have a Purpose</a>,” in <cite>Personal Development: Children’s Guidebook</cite> (2019), 1.</p>","referenceUris":[{"type":"cross-ref","href":"/study/manual/personal-development-childrens-guidebook/you-have-a-purpose?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1","text":"You Have a Purpose"}]},"note2":{"id":"note2","marker":"2.","pid":"173868253","context":"","text":"<p data-aid=\"173868461\" id=\"p_cRbDI\">“<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/personal-development-childrens-guidebook/you-have-a-purpose?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">You Have a Purpose</a>,” in <cite>Children’s Guidebook</cite>, 1.</p>","referenceUris":[{"type":"cross-ref","href":"/study/manual/personal-development-childrens-guidebook/you-have-a-purpose?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2","text":"You Have a Purpose"}]},"note3":{"id":"note3","marker":"3.","pid":"173868284","context":"","text":"<p data-aid=\"173868466\" id=\"p_jUrVY\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/1-ne/8?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\">1 Nephi 8:10</a>.</p>","referenceUris":[{"type":"scripture-ref","href":"/study/scriptures/bofm/1-ne/8?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10","text":"1 Nephi 8:10"}]},"note4":{"id":"note4","marker":"4.","pid":"173868284","context":"","text":"<p data-aid=\"173868473\" id=\"p_k7FLZ\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/1-ne/8?lang=eng&amp;id=p11#p11\">1